[20261113T123620Z](20261113T123620Z.md) is INCONCLUSIVE: active RX Continuous
and matching standby PHY were captured, but Tracker UPDI failed after SEND.
No TX_START/TX_DONE or receiver terminal event was acquired. The prior valid
negative RF result remains unchanged. Both boards were restored to verified
normal unarmed standby in `20261113T123837Z-standby`. KEEP diagnostics; no PHY
fix applied. No further RF test or ACK/NACK trial was run.
